WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:05.650
there's a political consultant who went on
MSNBC and said, if you were supporting Bernie

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:11.930
Sanders over Elizabeth Warren, given everything
that we know today, you are sexist.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.000
I wish that this was a fake headline.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.510
It is not.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:21.279
Let's look at the video of Emily Tish Sussman
saying this in her own words doing the thing

00:00:21.279 --> 00:00:26.199
where she says, some people are saying if
you support Bernie over Warren, it's sexist

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:28.689
and I think there might be something to it.

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:29.689
Take a look.

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:34.390
There's, there's a ceiling, there is nowhere
to go but there is no up to go.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.390
And all of those.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:40.040
I actually heard overheard someone saying
that I thought was an interesting point that

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.810
basically at this point if you are still supporting
Sanders as opposed to Warren, it's kind of

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.890
showing your sexism because she has more detailed
plans and her plans have evolved.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:52.460
I thought that was an interesting point and
I think there may be something to it.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:56.730
Yeah, I agree with all that.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:02.030
Uh, what there are about three, there's at
least three layers through which we need to

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.120
analyze this.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.729
Three lenses through, which we need to try
to understand this.

00:01:06.729 --> 00:01:09.780
First of all is just the sheer stupidity of
this comment.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:15.899
If you have two candidates and one is male
and another is female, if supporting the male

00:01:15.899 --> 00:01:23.999
is a sign of sexism against the female candidate,
then by extrapolation from that, if you have

00:01:23.999 --> 00:01:29.939
a Jewish candidate and a Christian candidate
and you support the Christian candidate, Elizabeth

00:01:29.939 --> 00:01:35.319
Warren in this case, that must be antisemitism
against the Jewish candidate Bernie Sanders,

00:01:35.319 --> 00:01:36.319
right?

00:01:36.319 --> 00:01:39.140
No, I would be an idiot if I tried to make
that argument.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:44.770
I would immediately lose all credibility to
put forth any kind of political analysis,

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.529
which is why I'm not going to make such a
stupid argument.

00:01:47.529 --> 00:01:53.330
And that's equally dumb as what, uh, Emily
Tish system assessments says here, uh, that's

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.049
the argument that's being made.

00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:59.429
And I hesitate to even use the term argument
because it's not really an argument.

00:01:59.429 --> 00:02:00.429
It's just nonsense.

00:02:00.429 --> 00:02:01.529
So that's problem number one.

00:02:01.529 --> 00:02:03.409
The argument is idiotic.

00:02:03.409 --> 00:02:09.720
Secondly, we have here the growing problem
that I've been telling you about.

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:15.980
Last week I did a segment where I said the
critiques from left to left, the critiques

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:22.600
among democratic primary voters of other democratic
candidates are starting to get to be the level

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:30.760
of toxicity, uh, that is going to hurt the
eventual nominee and helped Donald Trump in

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:31.760
2020.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:32.760
Okay.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:37.780
These are the types of more vicious and inaccurate
attacks that are going to self-destruct and

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.980
lead to the reelection of Donald Trump.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:45.210
And there are all sorts of reasons why someone
might support Bernie Sanders over Elizabeth

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:49.431
Warren and there are reasons people are supporting
Elizabeth Warren over Bernie Sanders, none

00:02:49.431 --> 00:02:51.870
of which have to do with religion or gender.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:57.580
Bernie, for example, has been clear that Medicare
for all is the path forward for healthcare.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.210
Now you can agree or disagree with that.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.320
That's his position.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.450
Elizabeth Warren has been more wishy washy.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.540
Now you might agree with Warren.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.980
There are reasonable people who can say, you
know, I don't want to put all my eggs in the

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:10.630
Medicare for all basket.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:15.130
And so I like Elizabeth Warren's more open
minded approach or you could say, I don't

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.730
see Elizabeth Warren is open-minded.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:21.180
Uh, I see her merely as wishy-washy and then
willing to take a position.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.760
I'm going with Bernie on this issue.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.130
None of that has to do with religion.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:26.370
None of that has to do with gender.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.880
Warren voted for a bigger Pentagon budget.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.210
Bernie voted against it.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.030
That might be a reason to vote for Bernie
has nothing to do with sexism.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:37.631
Obviously Bernie won't take corporate PAC
money in the general and Elizabeth Warren

00:03:37.631 --> 00:03:38.631
will.

00:03:38.631 --> 00:03:40.170
There's a big argument to be had about that.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:45.050
On the one hand, do you want someone who is
potentially going to be at a disadvantage

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:49.280
merely because they're saying, I won't take
PAC money and my opponent will and that hurts

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.280
me.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:55.700
Or you could say, I love that Bernie is not
going to compromise principles and he is not

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.050
going to take corporate pack money in the
general whatever.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.050
Right.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:04.420
I'm just telling you what the arguments are
to say that supporting the male candidate,

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:10.490
because as Emily Sussman said, Warren's plans
are more detailed, supposedly is absurd and

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:11.490
pathetic.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.510
It's, it actually is.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:16.580
It's so sad that this is what things have
come to.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:21.500
These are ridiculous attacks that are baseless
at their core, but they're destructive to

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.500
the movement.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:27.120
There are serious critiques and disagreements
anyone can have with Bernie or with Warren,

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.290
but this is absurd, childish and counter productive.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:34.910
Now the other thing, layer three as we might
call it, is that this particular consultant

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:40.400
or pundit or whatever, Emily Tish Sussman,
she is part of the democratic establishment

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.720
that has shown that they don't like Bernie.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:47.880
She's the former vice president of campaigns
for the center for American progress, an establishment

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.520
democratic outfit.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:56.210
Her father, Donald Sussman, was one of the
top Hillary donors in 2016 donating more than

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.640
$22 million to Hillary.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:01.840
So I think you probably understand what's
going on here.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.050
This is truly terrible stuff.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:05.290
You hate to see it.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:10.010
If what you care about is removing Donald
Trump in 2020 and unfortunately more and more

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.010
Democrats are doing it.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.730
I'm not saying everybody's the same.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:17.410
Not every candidate has this going on to the
same degree, but we've seen enclaves of toxic

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:19.050
Bernie supporters.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:23.230
We've seen toxic enclaves of Bernie detractors.

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:27.000
We've seen Biden supporters who were doing
right wing talking points about socialism

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.270
and communism, about Bernie and Warren.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:34.410
We've seen anti Biden, people that are going
well beyond what the evidence tells us should

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:38.030
be the case against Biden into what are smears.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:43.350
We've seen Warren detractors, we've seen the
cult of personality around Tulsi support around

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:46.600
Tulsi Gabard with some of our supporters,
yang supporters.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.540
I've been, some of them have been going over
the line.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.910
This is getting bad.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:55.790
This is exactly how we lose and I hope, I
mean, what else can I say?

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.561
I hope that everybody realizes this and abandons
this a strategy.

